            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Questions that the Codex desktop app asks you now show up on your Mac and as a read-only reminder on your paired iPhone, and they stay visible until you answer or the next turn starts.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Note</h3>
<ul>
<li>Pairs with the iPhone build 69, which restores the approval buttons on the lock screen.</li>
<li>Requires macOS 14.0 or later.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
